             * instrument than any statistic derived from the output text. Measured per page over a
             * recorded municipal ordinance (10 prose pages, 6 scanned survey/architectural drawings)
             * with Tesseract 5.5.3:
             *
             * ```text
             * prose      86.3 - 95.3
             * drawings   18.5 - 64.3
             * ```
